  book_index: 0
  book_title: A Veil of Dreams, a Lifetime of Love
  book_color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  book_clue_index: 117
  content: "Such a boring romance novel. Who even reads this stuff\u2026?"
  clue_content: "However, if I look through it carefully\u2026\n\nPage 5:\n\u201CGary,
    this sounds just like us.\u201D\n\u2014 \u201CIt does, Linda. This book is practically
    our story.\u201D\n\nPage 18:\n\u201CLinda, let\u2019s make up like this next
    time we argue.\u201D\n\u2014 \u201COkay~~\u201D\n\nPage 30:\n\u201CGary, they
    finally got married!\u201D\n\u2014 \u201CWe will too!\u201D\n\nThe next note
    seems to be in a different handwriting:\n\u201CYou two are the only reason I
    finished this book.\u201D\n"
